{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">想為平日的家常豬扒料理帶來新意？電視節目《流行都市》的「睇餸食飯」環節中， Leslie 陳國賓親自示範了一道清新可口的「青醬牛油果豬扒」。濃郁的羅勒香氣配合牛油果的綿密口感，做法簡單又滋味，大家不妨在家試做！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">食材與調味料準備</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">最後點綴： 乾紅椒碎 半茶匙</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">製作步驟</p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"21477407-9ce2-428e-aae5-028785197587.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20262AM4KBlIZM1790763169.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"21477407-9ce2-428e-aae5-028785197587.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"5a2c6e20-1ada-4053-9bb7-fb1c803236ba.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20266GOCgpNqPg1790763170.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5a2c6e20-1ada-4053-9bb7-fb1c803236ba.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-05T01:18:22.248816+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}